SUMMARY:Special Event: Usama Siddiquee
LOCATION:Goodnights Comedy Club\, 401 Woodburn Rd.\, Raleigh
DESCRIPTION:Usama Siddiquee is a Bengali-American stand-up comedian\, wri
 ter\, and actor based in New York City\, who can most recently be seen as a
  finalist (and fan favorite!) on Kevin Hart’s new series for Netflix\, 
  Funny AF .\n\nAs an actor\, Usama can be seen scene-stealing in Netflix
 ’s  Inventing Anna   and   Survival of the Thickest \, HBO’s  And J
 ust Like That \,  Comedy Central’s  Awkwafina Is Nora from Queens \,  
 and FX’s  Better Things .  He recently wrapped a supporting role in the
  upcoming Netflix comedy  Best of the Best \,  alongside Hasan Minhaj\, P
 riyanka Kedia\, and Maitreyi Ramakrishnan.\n\nIn 2024\, Usama made his late
 -night debut on  The Late Show with Stephen Colbert \,  and in 2025 rele
 ased his first half-hour special with Don’t Tell Comedy on YouTube. The s
 pecial highlights his signature high-energy\, rapid-fire style\, with mater
 ial ranging from growing up Muslim in Texas to dating misadventures and eve
 n getting kicked off  America’s Got Talent . Usama was named a New Fac
 e at the prestigious Just For Laughs Festival in 2018.\n\nCouple's Package 
 includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per perso
 n)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to pre
 vent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dange
 rous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/eve
 nt/special-event-usama-siddiquee/
